# 🚚 Driver Route — Delivery & Pickup

A mobile-friendly driver app prototype for managing equipment **delivery and pickup trips**. Drivers sign in with their ID, see their assigned truck, and view their upcoming deliveries and pickups.

**Live demo:** https://urdriver.lovable.app/

> ⚠️ This is a prototype. Authentication and data are mocked and should not be used in production as-is.

---

## ✨ Features

- 🔐 **Driver sign-in** with Driver ID and password
- 🚛 **Truck assignment** shown per driver
- 📦 **Deliveries & pickups** view for the day's trips
- 🌐 **Multilingual UI** — English, Español, हिन्दी
- 📱 **Responsive design**, built mobile-first for use on the road

