## 📁 Project Structure

```
├── public/             # Static assets
├── src/
│   ├── components/     # Reusable UI components
│   ├── pages/          # Sign-in and route/trip views
│   ├── i18n/           # Translations (EN, ES, HI)
│   ├── data/           # Mock drivers and trips
│   └── main.tsx        # App entry point
├── index.html
└── package.json
```

*(Adjust folders to match your repo.)*

---

## 🌍 Localization

The language selector on the sign-in screen supports:

- 🇺🇸 English
- 🇪🇸 Español
- 🇮🇳 हिन्दी

To add a language, create a new translation file and register it in the language selector.

